                                "sense_id": "c9a1e870-d7cd-3883-8650-8305d9dd099b",
                                "text": "One critic [Madeleine Schwartz] recently noted that the politics of Rooney’s novels were largely “gestural,” with airy mentions of Gaza or austerity protests but not much radical substance."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7945e905-6bbf-485c-acd4-2ba9207ff172",
                                "sense_id": "c9a1e870-d7cd-3883-8650-8305d9dd099b",
                                "text": "The video – posted by Trump on his Truth Social account last week – depicts a family emerging from the wreckage of war-torn Gaza into a beachside resort town lined with skyscrapers."
                            }
                        ]
